#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "Host name or IP address of the BMC, without https:// or a path."
msgstr "Sunan uwar garke ko adireshin IP na BMC, ba tare da https:// ko hanya ba."

#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "Do not verify is logged when set and shown as a warning on the health page while it stays."
msgstr "Ana yin rajistar 'Kada a tabbatar' lokacin da aka saita kuma ana nuna shi a matsayin gargaɗi a shafin lafiya muddin yana nan."

#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "CA Bundle File"
msgstr "Fayil ɗin CA Bundle"

#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "For the CA bundle mode: absolute path on the poller to a PEM file that others cannot write."
msgstr "Don yanayin CA bundle: cikakkiyar hanya akan poller zuwa fayil ɗin PEM wanda wasu ba za su iya rubutawa ba."

#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "For the pinned mode: base64 SHA-256 of the BMC public key, as sha256//... or the bare hash. A changed key fails until this is updated."
msgstr "Don yanayin da aka maƙala (pinned): base64 SHA-256 na maɓallin jama'a na BMC, kamar sha256//... ko hash ɗin kawai. Maɓallin da aka canza zai gaza har sai an sabunta wannan."

#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "Public Key Pin"
msgstr "Pin ɗin Maɓallin Jama'a"

#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "Allow Basic Authentication Fallback"
msgstr "Ba da Izinin Madadin Tantancewar Basic"

#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "Used only when the BMC offers no session service. Every request then carries the password; the health page warns while it is in use."
msgstr "Ana amfani da shi kaɗai idan BMC ba ta da sabis na zama (session service). Kowane buƙata zai ɗauki kalmar sirri; shafin lafiya zai yi gargaɗi yayin da ake amfani da shi."

#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "The Cacti device of the server this BMC manages. Leave it at none to have the plugin create a device from the list."
msgstr "Na'urar Cacti ta uwar garken da wannan BMC ke sarrafawa. Bar shi a babu ko ɗaya don plugin ɗin ya ƙirƙiri na'ura daga jerin."

