#: lib/CredentialsPage.php
msgid "A BMC account with the ReadOnly role. The plugin never needs a role that can change BMC state."
msgstr "Asusun BMC mai matsayin ReadOnly. Plugin ɗin ba ya taɓa buƙatar matsayin da zai iya canza yanayin BMC."

#: lib/CredentialsPage.php
msgid "A password is stored. Leave blank to keep it."
msgstr "An ajiye kalmar sirri. Bar shi fanko don ci gaba da riƙe ta."

#: lib/CredentialsPage.php
msgid "Stored encrypted with the vault key."
msgstr "An ajiye shi a ɓoye tare da maɓallin ma'ajiya (vault key)."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The Redfish templates are not installed completely. Reinstall them from the Redfish BMCs page."
msgstr "Ba a shigar da samfuran Redfish gaba ɗaya ba. Sake shigar da su daga shafin Redfish BMCs."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "A device \"%s\" from the %s device template, polled by poller %d, with availability checks off. Its host name is a reserved name that is never contacted."
msgstr "Na'ura \"%s\" daga samfurin na'urar %s, wadda poller %d ke tattarawa, tare da kashe duba samuwa. Sunan uwar garkenta suna ne da aka tanada wanda ba a taɓa tuntuɓarsa ba."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "The data query \"%s\", with a graph for each of the %d members known now."
msgstr "Tambayar bayanai \"%s\", tare da jadawali ga kowanne daga cikin mambobi %d da aka sani yanzu."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d fans or power supplies that were present are no longer reported. They count as failed until you confirm; confirming accepts the members the BMC reports now."
msgstr "Fankuna ko na'urorin wutar lantarki %d da suka kasance a nan ba a ƙara ba da rahoton su ba. Ana ƙididdige su a matsayin waɗanda suka gaza har sai ka tabbatar; tabbatarwa tana karɓar mambobin da BMC ke ba da rahoto yanzu."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "The graph \"%s\", with its \"%s\" data source."
msgstr "Jadawalin \"%s\", tare da tushen bayanansa na \"%s\"."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The BMC is already mapped to a device."
msgstr "An riga an haɗa BMC ɗin zuwa wata na'ura."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "Created by the Redfish plugin for BMC %s. Its values come from the plugin cache; the host name is a reserved name that is never contacted."
msgstr "Plugin ɗin Redfish ne ya ƙirƙire shi don BMC %s. Ƙimominsa sun fito ne daga ma'ajiyar wucin gadi (cache) ta plugin ɗin; sunan uwar garken suna ne da aka tanada wanda ba a taɓa tuntuɓarsa ba."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "Cacti refused to create the device. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Cacti ta ƙi ƙirƙirar na'urar. Duba rajistar Cacti."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The new device would be hidden from you by your device permissions, so it was removed again. Ask an administrator to grant access, or map the BMC to a device you can see."
msgstr "Sabuwar na'urar za ta kasance a ɓoye daga gare ka saboda izinin na'urarka, don haka an sake cire ta. Nemi mai gudanarwa ya ba ka dama, ko ka haɗa BMC ɗin zuwa na'urar da za ka iya gani."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The BMC was mapped to a device by someone else meanwhile, or could not be mapped, so the new device was removed again. Reload the page and check its mapping."
msgstr "Wani ya haɗa BMC ɗin zuwa wata na'ura a halin yanzu, ko kuma ba a iya haɗa shi ba, don haka an sake cire sabuwar na'urar. Sake loda shafin kuma ka duba haɗinsa."

#: lib/DeviceWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "The Redfish templates could not be installed: %s"
msgstr "Ba a iya shigar da samfuran Redfish ba: %s"

#: lib/DeviceWarnings.php
msgid "The Redfish templates are not installed or not current. Reinstall them from the Redfish BMCs page."
msgstr "Ba a shigar da samfuran Redfish ba ko ba na yanzu ba ne. Sake shigar da su daga shafin Redfish BMCs."

#: lib/DeviceWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s: its Cacti device was deleted. Map it to another device or create one from the BMCs page."
msgstr "%s: an share na'urarta ta Cacti. Haɗa ta zuwa wata na'ura ko ka ƙirƙiri ɗaya daga shafin BMCs."

#: lib/DeviceWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s: its device is polled by poller %d but the BMC is read by poller %d. Move one of them so both use the same poller, or its graphs can read as unknown."
msgstr "%s: poller %d ne ke tattara na'urarta amma poller %d ke karanta BMC ɗin. Matsar da ɗayansu don dukansu su yi amfani da poller iri ɗaya, ko kuma jadawalanta za su iya karantawa a matsayin waɗanda ba a sani ba."

