#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Credential Vault"
msgstr "Ma'ajiyar Sirri ta Shaidar Shiga"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Vault Key File"
msgstr "Fayil ɗin Maɓallin Ma'ajiyar Sirri"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to the 32-byte key that encrypts stored BMC passwords. Create it yourself, outside the web root, readable only by the web server and poller user, in a directory that only root and that user can write; the plugin never creates or writes it. Back it up with the database: without it, stored passwords must be entered again."
msgstr "Cikakkiyar hanya zuwa maɓallin 32-byte wanda ke ɓoye kalmomin sirrin BMC da aka ajiye. Ƙirƙire shi da kanka, a wajen web root, wanda uwar garken yanar gizo da mai amfani na poller kaɗai za su iya karantawa, a cikin babban fayil da root da wannan mai amfani kaɗai za su iya rubutawa; plugin ɗin ba ya taɓa ƙirƙira ko rubuta shi. Ajiye masa kwafi tare da rumbun adana bayanai (database): ba tare da shi ba, dole ne a sake shigar da kalmomin sirrin da aka ajiye."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collector"
msgstr "Mai Tattara Bayanai"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collection Interval"
msgstr "Tazarar Tattara Bayanai"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds between reads of each BMC."
msgstr "Daƙiƙoƙi tsakanin karatun kowane BMC."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Rediscovery Interval"
msgstr "Tazarar Sake Ganowa"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds between full resource discoveries of each BMC. A BMC is also rediscovered at once when a known resource disappears or changes type."
msgstr "Daƙiƙoƙi tsakanin cikakken gano albarkatun kowane BMC. Ana kuma sake gano BMC nan da nan idan wata albarkatu da aka sani ta ɓace ko ta canza nau'i."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collector Time Budget"
msgstr "Ƙayyadadden Lokacin Mai Tattara Bayanai"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one collector run may spend before it stops starting new BMCs. Keep it below the poller interval; unfinished BMCs resume on the next run."
msgstr "Daƙiƙoƙin da zagaye ɗaya na mai tattarawa zai iya ɗauka kafin ya daina fara sababbin BMCs. Ka sanya shi ƙasa da tazarar poller; BMCs da ba a kammala ba za su ci gaba a zagaye na gaba."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "BMCs read in parallel. Each BMC is read by one worker at a time."
msgstr "BMCs da ake karantawa a lokaci guda. Ma'aikaci ɗaya ke karanta kowane BMC a lokaci guda."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collector Workers"
msgstr "Ma'aikatan Mai Tattarawa"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Connect Timeout"
msgstr "Ƙarewar Lokacin Haɗi"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds allowed for the TCP connection and TLS handshake to a BMC."
msgstr "Daƙiƙoƙin da aka yarda don haɗin TCP da gaisuwar TLS zuwa BMC."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Request Timeout"
msgstr "Ƙayyadadden Lokacin Buƙata"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds allowed for one whole request to a BMC, including the connection."
msgstr "Daƙiƙoƙin da aka yarda don cikakkiyar buƙata guda ɗaya zuwa BMC, gami da haɗin."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "KiB accepted in one BMC response body; a larger response is refused."
msgstr "KiB da aka karɓa a cikin jikin amsar BMC guda ɗaya; ana ƙin amincewa da amsar da ta fi girma."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Maximum Response Size"
msgstr "Mafi Girman Girman Amsa"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Freshness"
msgstr "Sabuntawa"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collection intervals after which a reading is shown as delayed."
msgstr "Tazarorin tattarawa waɗanda bayan su za a nuna karatu a matsayin wanda ya makara."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Delayed After"
msgstr "Ya Makara Bayan"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collection intervals after which a reading is stale and reads as unknown. Always at least one more than Delayed After."
msgstr "Tazarorin tattarawa waɗanda bayan su karatu zai zama tsoho (stale) kuma a karanta shi a matsayin wanda ba a sani ba. Kullum ya kasance a ƙalla ɗaya fiye da Ya Makara Bayan."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Stale After"
msgstr "Ya Wuce Lokaci Bayan"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Cirewa"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Riƙe Teburan Plugin yayin Cirewa"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its BMC registry, encrypted passwords, and reading cache. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them. Uninstall never touches Cacti devices, graphs, or BMCs, including devices the plugin created."
msgstr "Idan aka zaɓa, cire shigarwar plugin ɗin zai riƙe rajistar BMC, kalmomin sirri da aka ɓoye, da ma'ajiyar wucin gadi (cache) ta karatu. Share shi don cire shigarwar ya goge su. Cire shigarwar ba ya taɓa na'urorin Cacti, jadawalai, ko BMCs, gami da na'urorin da plugin ɗin ya ƙirƙira."

#: lib/TlsMode.php
msgid "Verify against the system CA store"
msgstr "Tabbatar da ma'ajiyar CA ta tsarin"

#: lib/TlsMode.php
msgid "Verify against a CA bundle file"
msgstr "Tabbatar da fayil ɗin CA bundle"

#: lib/TlsMode.php
msgid "Pinned public key (SHA-256)"
msgstr "Maɓallin jama'a da aka maƙala (SHA-256)"

#: lib/TlsMode.php
msgid "Do not verify (unsafe)"
msgstr "Kada a tabbatar (ba shi da aminci)"

